    "Scan of the 1948 edition of the Underhill, Vermont, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the Army Map Service and the U.S. Army Corps of Engineers. Aerial photographs from 1978; field checked in 1948; photo inspected in 1983; photo revised in 1980; last revised in 1980; printed in 1990.",
